            "text": "theorem lemma_4_1_2 {α Q : ℝ} {a : ℤ} {q : ℕ} (h : Approx α a q Q) {y₁ y₂ : ℝ}\n    (hy : 0 ≤ y₁) (_hy₁₂ : y₁ < y₂) (hlen : y₂ - y₁ ≤ q) (hy₂ : y₂ ≤ Q / 2) {A C : ℝ}\n    (hA : 0 ≤ A) (hC : 0 ≤ C) :\n    ∑ n ∈ Finset.Ioc ⌊y₁⌋ ⌊y₂⌋,\n        (if (q : ℤ) ∣ n then 0 else min A (C / Real.sin (π * α * n) ^ 2)) ≤\n      min (20 / (3 * π ^ 2) * C * q ^ 2) (2 * A + 4 * q / π * √(A * C)) :=",
